   "title": "I renewed my maintenance on my DSD enhancement. What do I need to do to update it in our system?",
   "sourceUrl": "",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1673028290726\" id=\"item-62d9abbb9a630f3a59048f3e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-border-radii=\"&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-aaf67e4505a0d6fe1336\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">I renewed my maintenance on my Sage 100 ERP DSD enhancement. What do I need to do to update it in our Sage 100 ERP system?</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-image image-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.imageLayout/d45c9b48-ae26-4b28-96cf-c1292e07f93b_324/website.components.imageLayout.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.imageLayout/d45c9b48-ae26-4b28-96cf-c1292e07f93b_324/website.components.imageLayout.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.imageLayout\" data-sqsp-block=\"image-classic\" data-website-component-id=\"7b188f4d09d478947787\" id=\"block-7b188f4d09d478947787\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n  <div\n    class=\"\n      imag